    <object id="wireless-mc154" label="&lt;b&gt;Rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;· HALVERN-PUBLIC: client isolation, splash page, content filter, 10 Mb/s per client; lands in PUBLIC only.&lt;br&gt;· PD-SECURE: EAP-TLS with police device certificates; broadcast by the police wing APs only.&lt;br&gt;· No SSID for cameras, door controllers, HVAC or card terminals: they are wired.&lt;br&gt;· Rogue AP detection on; management VLAN 99 is never broadcast." netdiagrams_guide="1">
